<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 403-5 AT TEA V ENGLAND IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 403-5 AT TEA V ENGLAND IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, 360 runs behind England on first innings, were 403 for five wickets in their second innings at tea on the fourth day of the first test at Edgbaston on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 118 and 403-5 (M.Taylor 129, G.Blewett 125, M.Elliott 66), England 478-9 declared.</p>
